Azure Function App with Monitoring and Alerts
Overview

This Terraform project provisions an Azure Function App along with Application Insights, Log Analytics Workspace, and alerts using Azure Monitor. It includes setting up a resource group, app service plan, storage account, application insights, and alerting for anomalies and HTTP 5xx errors.
